      ],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0420",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 19:30 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:15 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 22:30 I was at Mill Road; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
